  "description": "Semantic Kernel plugins for Caveman (NLP Prompt Compressor): prompt token optimization, conversation/agent context tools (summarize, fit-to-budget, memory, focus, token estimate), developer services and on-demand project documentation. Add-on package; references the dependency-free Caveman core. Licensed under the Caveman License (MIT + mandatory attribution to Passaro Francesco Paolo - Digitalsolutions.it).",
