  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.1: aligned with Caveman core 1.3.1 (replaces 1.3.0 which was missing key services in the NuGet package). CavemanConversationPlugin gains five new functions wrapping CavemanSharedContext and CavemanMessageDeduplicator: share_context (compress + store under a key for inter-agent sharing, TTL 30 min), get_shared_context (retrieve compressed or original by key), shared_context_stats (aggregate token savings across all live entries), dedup_messages (scan a message sequence for re-read duplicates, reports wasted tokens), clean_duplicate_messages (replace duplicates with [duplicate of message #N] placeholders). CavemanRouterPlugin, CavemanOutputPlugin and all other plugins unchanged.",
